### Telecom Customer API – IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### Full reference: http://localhost:8080/docs/index.html
@api = http://localhost:8080/api

### Plans (public)
GET {{api}}/v1/plans

### Create customer (agent)
POST {{api}}/v1/customers
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Karthik R","email":"karthik@example.com","msisdn":"9988776655","planCode":"DATA-299"}

### Get customer v1
GET {{api}}/v1/customers/1
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass

### Get customer v2
GET {{api}}/v2/customers/1
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass

### List customers
GET {{api}}/v1/customers?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=20&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass

### Suspend
PATCH {{api}}/v1/customers/1/status
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"SUSPENDED","reason":"Non-payment"}

### Delete as agent -> 403
DELETE {{api}}/v1/customers/1
Authorization: Basic agent agent-pass

### Delete as admin -> 204
DELETE {{api}}/v1/customers/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin-pass
